  "sourceTitle": "Poppyseed Dressing",
  "sourceText": "Poppyseed Dressing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 4:18am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\ncup Sugar\n2 tablespoons Vinegar\n1 tablespoon Lemon juice\nteaspoon Salt\nteaspoon Dry mustard\ncup Veg. oil\n1 tablespoon Poppy seed\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix first 5 ingredients together. Gradually add oil, beating with electric mixer or hand beater until thick & smooth; stir in poppy seed. Cover & refrigerate at least 2 hours.",
